license: MIT
abstract: >
  A PyTorch implementation of hierarchical multi-label patent classification
  by fine-tuning sentence transformers (BERT-based models). Classifies patent
  abstracts into the International Patent Classification (IPC) hierarchy with
  parent-child constraints between classification levels (Section, Class, Subclass).
keywords:
  - patent classification
  - hierarchical multi-label classification
  - natural language processing
  - BERT
  - SciBERT
  - IPC
  - machine learning
